terminal ROIC




check why RACE differs from analyst forecasts
uv run edgarito valuation   --ticker RACE   --market eu   --profile configs/valuation/race.json

compare intrinsic and market-relative values without mixing the models
uv run edgarito valuation --ticker RACE --market eu --provider-symbol yahoo=RACE.MI --profile configs/valuation/race.json --model both --peer RMS.PA --peer CFR.SW --peer MONC.MI --peer P911.DE


